  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "🪐 Planet Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for alien worlds, catalogued exoplanets, human colonies and moons."
    },
    "intro": "Real planets get catalogue numbers; the ones in stories get names. This **planet name generator** makes both: alien-sounding worlds, survey catalogue designations, human colonies named after home, and descriptive names like Glasswater, with a numeral or the kind of world if you want one.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "How real planets are named",
